sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Crawler as Sitemap / Crawl Worker
  participant Safety as HTTP Fetch Safety & Host Allowlist
  participant Extractor as Text & PDF Extractor
  participant Chunker as Parent-Child Chunker
  participant Embedder as Gemini Embedding 2 (768-dim)
  participant DB as Convex DB (documents, chunks, vectors)
  participant Cache as Cache Invalidator

  Crawler->>Safety: Discover & Validate URL
  Safety-->>Crawler: Approved Endpoint
  Crawler->>Extractor: Fetch Raw Document
  Extractor-->>Crawler: Extracted Content & Structure
  Crawler->>Chunker: Split Content into Chunks
  Chunker-->>Crawler: Parent Chunks & Child Chunks
  Crawler->>Embedder: Generate 768-dim Embeddings
  Embedder-->>Crawler: Vectors
  Crawler->>DB: Atomic Mutation (Publish Version, Chunks, Embeddings)
  DB-->>Cache: Trigger Invalidation for Stale/Superseded Records
